v 3
d 'ssc2': Install Stata packages from date-based snapshots of the SSC archive
d
d This is a drop-in replacement for the system-provided ssc command,
d allowing installation of date-specific snapshots of packages from
d a mirror of the SSC archive. It adds a date() option that selects
d a snapshot of SSC as of that date, and a from() option to point at
d an alternative mirror. Where nothing snapshot-specific is requested,
d ssc2 delegates to the official ssc command.
d
d KW: technical
d KW: snapshot
d KW: reproducibility
d
d Requires: Stata version 14 (https support; to be confirmed)
d
d Version: 2.2.2
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
d Authors: Lars Vilhuber
d Support: https://github.com/labordynamicsinstitute/stata-ssc2/issues
f ado/ssc2.ado
f sthlp/ssc2.sthlp
